exports[`rhachet roles boot — the budget gate, on a role coordinate given: [case3] a role spec that EXCEEDS the budget it declares when: [t0] roles boot --repo .this --role any then: the halt renders as snapshotted — on STDERR: stderr-boot-over 1`] = `
"🧢 roles boot --repo .this --role any
   ├─ ✋ ConstraintError: over budget
   │  ├─ budget   = 20 tokens   (declared in boot.yml)
   │  ├─ payload  = 335 tokens   (full emitted payload, o200k_base)
   │  └─ over by  = 315 tokens   (1675% of budget)
   │
   ├─ some resources must go — you choose which
   │  └─ rhx cost --repo .this --role any   sorts every batch by what it costs
   │
   └─ fix — four strategies, cheapest first
      ├─ catalogize  replace a set with one catalog that indexes it
      ├─ condense    author an x.md.min beside x.md
      ├─ reference   move a say entry to ref (it stays addressable, costs its path line)
      └─ eliminate   list what does not earn its boot under \`not\` (the file stays)


✋ ConstraintError: boot payload exceeds its declared budget

{
  "hint": "trim a resource — catalogize a set, condense or ref a say entry, list one under \`not\` — or raise budget.tokens deliberately",
  "budget": 20,
  "payload": 335,
  "over": 315
}

[args] roles,boot,--repo,.this,--role,any

"
`;

